rows.en:
Next... let's see, let's read about the walls you'll have to get over to make your dream come true.
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, please answer.
Would you tell us what will hold {c}{f:|} back from making that dream real?{p}

Ah, it says you'll be torn between love and your dream.
Do you put your lover first, or your dream...?
That's a tough one.
But it says you'll make your dream come true, so what becomes of your lover then...
{f:Well, I hope you can have it all|If I were the one, though, you'd have it all}: your dream and your love{f:, both of them.|. I'd never make you give up either.}
Now, what shall we read next?{p}

Hmm, looks like the walls the world puts up are thick.
No matter what people say to you, keep at it.
So, what shall we read next?{p}

Life is full of all sorts of mountains and valleys and rivers and forests and woods and birds and flowers and butterflies.
...You don't get what I'm saying?
Oh well. So, what shall we read next?{p}

Next... let's see, let's read about the people who'll help you make that dream real.
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, please answer.
Who on earth will help {c}{f:|} with that dream?{p}

It says your lover will be a big support to you.
I wonder what they're like.
Is there anyone you'd think of that way right now?
If not, I guess they'll show up later on.
{f:Honestly|Or wait}, {f:you're one|maybe it's the one right in front of you}{f: lucky devil.|: me.}
So, what shall we read next?{p}

Very well, then I shall divine it for you.
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, please answer.
Will {c}{f:|} live a fun, carefree life in the future?{p}

Mm, very well, I shall divine it for you.
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, please answer.
Will {c}{f:|} get to lead a turbulent life in the future?{p}

I see. Then I shall divine it for you.
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, please answer.
Will {c}{f:|} be able to live a stable, steady life in the future?{p}

...Don't give me such a scary look.
{f:I'm kidding|You're hurting my feelings}.
{f:Like I'd ever lend|And here I was, all set} {f:my chest to a guy.|to hold you tight.}{p}

Leave me alone.
Never mind about me.
If you've got nothing else you want to ask, I'm going to ask Kokkuri-san to leave.{p}
